2.0.1 2026-11-18
  - 14 sub-*/nirs/*_channels.tsv: channel names written as MNE-Python derives them from the SNIRF measurement list ("S1-D1-690.0" -> "S1_D1 690"); row order and the other columns unchanged; type MISC -> NIRSCWAMPLITUDE (SNIRF dataType 1)
  - 14 *_nirs.json: Manufacturer TechEn, ManufacturersModelName CW6 and CapManufacturer EasyCap added (doi:10.3389/fnhum.2024.1329086, Methods, Data acquisition); RecordingDuration and RecordingType computed from the SNIRF time vector of each recording; the one file published on a single line is rewritten with one key per line (values unchanged)
  - dataset_description.json: DatasetType "raw" (the BIDS default), EthicsApprovals and Funding (doi:10.3389/fnhum.2024.1329086, Ethics statement and Funding) added; BIDSVersion 1.7.1 -> 1.8.0 (the nirs datatype exists in BIDS from version 1.8.0)
  - sourcedata/: the published versions of the files whose values change in this version (14 channels.tsv), byte-identical at the same relative path (plain git files)
  - dataset_description.json: Version 1.0.0 -> 2.0.1
2.0.0 2026-02-27
  - Updated nirs.json and events.tsv files and changed the filenaming with tasks to make it BIDS compliant.
